{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE37nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponentsSays10ArraySliceVy6VertexQzGGyF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"ArraySlice","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s10ArraySliceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">]","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/NontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L89","fileName":"NontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents.swift"},"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Connectivity","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s10ArraySliceV","text":"ArraySlice"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">]"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm, one pass: a self-loop is noticed while the search reads the vertex’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"successors.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The components are those of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stronglyConnectedComponents()"},{"text":" without the trivial ones, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same order, a reverse topological order: every path between two of them goes from a later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one to an earlier one. Each lists its vertices in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order. Empty exactly when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graph is acyclic. Each is a slice of one shared array, as in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attractingComponents()"},{"text":", so its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indices do not start at 0.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":", so one sort by that vertex’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position puts the components in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(C log C) for C components. On a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"type":"text","text":", where positions are insertion order:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(V + E).","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/nontrivialstronglyconnectedcomponents()"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The nontrivial strongly connected components: the ones that contain a cycle, which are the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components of two or more vertices and the single vertices with a self-loop. A vertex is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one exactly when it lies on a cycle, and two vertices share one exactly when a cycle passes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through both.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","abstract":[],"title":"DirectedGraph","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedGraph"}],"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"nontrivialStronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s10ArraySliceV","text":"ArraySlice","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text